  m_text: Boss health is 1,000,000 multiplied by the raid tier, so each tier is a
    strictly harder fight than the last. Guild damage per tick is 10 per member level
    summed across the roster, which means recruiting and levelling members is the
    only way to raise raid DPS. Victory awards 100 guild contribution points.
